        "product_summary": "Side-zip entry: A visible side zipper opens the ankle-height upper, offering an alternative to lace fastening.\n\nTextured upper panels: Creased surface details, curved side seams and a rear-quarter panel define the casual boot profile.\n\nSculpted PVC sole: The source identifies the sole as PVC. Raised sidewall sections and the stitched-looking toe outline give the boot a pronounced utility-inspired shape.\n\nRear pull loop: A visible loop above the heel provides a place to grip the boot when putting it on.\n\nAssortment planning: Black, Grey and Khaki are listed in EU38-45. Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
      },
